            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.4+JER.52.5+JER.52.6+JER.52.7+JER.52.8+JER.52.9+JER.52.10+JER.52.11+JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "52.4-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino dwe abic, dwe me apar, i mwaka me apar wiye aryo, ma onoŋo doŋ giterowa watye i opii, dano mo ma obwot ki i Jerucalem obino bota ci otitta ni gaŋ me Jerucalem doŋ opoto woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otyeno ma onoŋo dano-nu pud peya obino bota, onoŋo doŋ alimo tek ma nyuto ni Rwot onoŋo odiya ki ciŋe i cawa meno. I odiko ma doŋ dano-nu obino bota ci Rwot oyabo doga omiya teko me lok ci doga oyabbe, pe dok abedo ma doga oto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
